 "finalMessage": "Fixed `urlPatternsOverlap` (src/features/permissions/shadowed-allows.ts) so URLs carrying userinfo, a query string or a fragment are compared by their host and path only. Added `stripUrlExtras`, which strips the scheme (via the existing `stripUrlSchemeKeepingPathCase`), drops the query (`?\u2026`) and fragment (`#\u2026`), and removes userinfo up to the last `@` in the authority, keeping the host and path. "
